# Form: NEW project-specific skill

This is a small Agent Skills structure, **not** a replacement for a global
skill-builder or a requirement to install one. First find an existing project skill
and responsibility. Create only a distinct useful procedure, not a wrapper for every
document. Default output: project's selected skill directory / `<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
Follow the client's verified project connection, not an assumed universal loader.

Copy payload only, fill agent placeholders. `name` must match its parent directory:
1–64 lower-case letters/digits/hyphens, no leading/trailing/consecutive hyphen.
Description 1–1024 characters: meaningful action and trigger. `metadata` is a mapping
of **strings to strings**, including version/date. No ordinary-document id/kind/status
passport. Do not add tool grants, client-specific controls or a license without their
owner's actual decision. Omit metadata keys that have no use, not core name/description.
Essential body sections below all stay; add resources/scripts only for real need.

Official format: [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io/specification).
Shared-form boundary: [metadata](../../references/metadata.md).

